Description: said — portable single-file brain (personal memory)
 said is a portable personal memory in a single .said file. Store notes, facts,
 decisions, and preferences, and recall them by meaning in plain English — on
 the terminal (said) or through an AI agent over MCP (said-mcp). Offline, no
 cloud, no LLM inside; the encoder is embedded in the binary.
